    "innovation": "This paper quantifies the spectral effects of rotational-Raman scattering (RRS) in the O2 A- and B-bands, demonstrating that this often-neglected signal is comparable in magnitude to chlorophyll fluorescence and can bias high-precision atmospheric trace-gas retrievals under various conditions.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
